// UNIVAC 1103 - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

* UNIVAC 1103 Fortran. The control column is the seventh;
* columns 1-6 are the statement number.
      PROGRAM HELLO
      WRITE(6,10)
10    FORMAT(1X,'HELLO WORLD')
      END
